      </dl>
      <p>The following example <code>ConfigMap</code> (CR) contains one environment variable:</p>
      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: v1\nkind: ConfigMap\nmetadata:\n  name: env-config\n  namespace: default\ndata:\n  log_level: INFO"} lang="yaml" />
      <p>where:</p>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>metadata.name</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the name of the config map.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>metadata.namespace</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the project in which the config map resides. Config maps can only be referenced by pods in the same project.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>data</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the environment variables to inject.</p></dd>
